{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依廢棄物清理法（以下簡稱本法）第二十八條第三項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070077/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"43ea419ef0123498d227477f5165722f156babacd294e34a1011c01c7cc1e0b2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":32,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法所稱營建廢棄物共同清除處理機構（以下簡稱共同清理機構），指由營造業及其他經中央主管機關指定與營建有關之事業，共同投資合作或聯合具清除、處理該類廢棄物意願之業者加入投資所設立之機構。","id":"D0070077/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"dc1071d94376d4bad53ad1aa6e4a3bb8e1a5bab423aa2be64c68edf697dd93fe","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":93,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構之級別及條件如下：\n一、甲級：應具備條件如下：\n（一）資本額新臺幣一千五百萬元以上。\n（二）清除、處理廢棄物之設施及設備。\n（三）廢棄物清除處理設施用地面積合計二公頃以上。\n（四）置有專業技術人員一人以上。\n二、乙級：應具備資格條件如下：\n（一）資本額新臺幣一百萬元以上。\n（二）清除、處理廢棄物之設施及設備。\n（三）廢棄物清除處理，設施用地面積合計零點五公頃以上。\n（四）置有專業技術人員一人以上。\n共同清理機構清除、處理廢棄物之種類及數量，由內政部定之。","id":"D0070077/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"dca86872bf3c52091d09be0a6572b6128e83fc0bc7af71114654a9e3fad672f1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":207,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":16,"end":110,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":30,"end":49,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":49,"end":68,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:3","kind":"subitem","number":3,"start":68,"end":93,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:1/s:4","kind":"subitem","number":4,"start":93,"end":110,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":110,"end":207,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":126,"end":143,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":143,"end":162,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:3","kind":"subitem","number":3,"start":162,"end":190,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:1/i:2/s:4","kind":"subitem","number":4,"start":190,"end":207,"children":[]}]}]},{"id":"D0070077/a:3/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":207,"end":235,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構應經直轄市、縣（市）政府許可後，始得設置；並經直轄市、縣（市）政府核發營運登記證後，始得營運。","id":"D0070077/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"d3092c9c014390b7f759e14191aee409038d8c68e0071fb50a2fac87ce465d9b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":53,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"申請籌設共同清理機構者，應檢具下列文件，向直轄市、縣（市）政府申請設立許可：\n一、申請書。\n二、資本額證明文件。\n三、投資者名冊。\n四、廢棄物清除、處理設施與設備規格功能及處理能力說明書。\n五、廢棄物清除、處理設施用地土地權利證明文件。\n六、專業技術人員資格證明文件。\n七、工程計畫說明書。但使用既有合法場（廠）設施者，免附。\n八、污染防治計畫書。\n九、營運管理計畫說明書。\n十、廢棄物最終處置方式。","id":"D0070077/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"07e7d19531637e9be08cc37f6ee8c69962ff11773f7a2ac855e02a411a46fbc5","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":200,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":39,"end":46,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":46,"end":57,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":57,"end":66,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":66,"end":95,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":95,"end":119,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":119,"end":135,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":135,"end":164,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:8","kind":"item","number":8,"start":164,"end":175,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:9","kind":"item","number":9,"start":175,"end":188,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:5/p:1/i:10","kind":"item","number":10,"start":188,"end":200,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"申請籌設共同清理機構者，應於直轄市、縣（市）政府核發設立許可函後六個月內，完成公司或商業登記。但有正當理由者，得申請延期六個月，並以一次為限。","id":"D0070077/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"73b43d102ff4537a005c7e9842f1e6d0efd99e6ea1fa1e6fadf4d6113aad7533","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":71,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構應於領得公司或商業登記證明文件後三個月內，檢具下列文件，向直轄市、縣（市）政府申請核發營運登記證：\n一、申請書。\n二、設立許可函。\n三、公司或商業登記證明文件。\n四、清除、處理設施完工驗收證明文件。但使用既有合法場（廠）設施者，免附。\n五、廢棄物最終處置去處同意文件。\n六、其他經直轄市、縣（市）政府指定應備之文件。\n未於前項規定期限內申請者，直轄市、縣（市）政府應廢止其設立許可。但有正當理由者，得申請延期三個月，並以一次為限。","id":"D0070077/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"7e34412082ee405b5f31d5a0d2648f01d968b5c68a340f667949d64f3e1d0a6d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":165,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":56,"end":63,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":63,"end":72,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":72,"end":87,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":87,"end":124,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":124,"end":141,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":141,"end":165,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070077/a:7/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":165,"end":221,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構之營運登記證應載明下列事項：\n一、核准字號、日期。\n二、機構名稱及地址。\n三、負責人姓名、住址及身分證明文件字號。\n四、場（廠）地點。\n五、清除、處理廢棄物之種類、數量、處理方法、中間處理或最終處置地點。\n六、有效期限。\n七、其他經內政部指定或相關法令規定之登載事項。","id":"D0070077/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"5296b373940c17988bfaf1d45c327988db75c211efcc3753445f933a31d998e9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":140,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":21,"end":32,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":32,"end":43,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":43,"end":64,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":64,"end":74,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":74,"end":109,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":109,"end":117,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:8/p:1/i:7","kind":"item","number":7,"start":117,"end":140,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"營運登記證之有效期限為五年。\n共同清理機構應於營運登記證期限屆滿前三個月內，檢具下列文件，向直轄市、縣（市）政府申請換發：\n一、申請書。\n二、設立許可函。\n三、原營運登記證。\n四、資本額證明文件。\n五、專業技術人員資格證明文件。\n六、其他經直轄市、縣（市）政府指定應備之文件。\n合於前項規定者，直轄市、縣（市）政府應核發新營運登記證；不合規定者，駁回其申請；其須補正者，應通知限期補正，屆期未補正者，駁回其申請。","id":"D0070077/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"2b7c25ccd513a4a05131baf1cf4f3a3bb3a7ff64014cd52304fc5db6c4a073eb","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":15,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":15,"end":139,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":62,"end":69,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":69,"end":78,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":78,"end":88,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":88,"end":99,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":99,"end":115,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:2/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":115,"end":139,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070077/a:9/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":139,"end":206,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構許可或營運登記證登載事項變更時，應依下列規定辦理：\n一、營運登記證之機構名稱、地址及負責人姓名、住址或身分證明文件字號變更時，應於變更後三十日內，檢附有關證明文件，向直轄市、縣（市）政府辦理變更登記。\n二、前款以外之許可或營運登記證登載事項變更時，應於變更前檢附有關證明文件，向直轄市、縣（市）政府申請並經核准後，始得變更。\n前項營運登記證登載事項變更時，直轄市、縣（市）政府應於營運登記證上註記。","id":"D0070077/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"c302ed4784476cda25cfb92bf57de09df0e0a02fd69b3be39fbb10578c840a04","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":169,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:10/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":32,"end":107,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:10/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":107,"end":169,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070077/a:10/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":169,"end":205,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構應將每日清除、處理情形逐項作成營運紀錄，隨其清除、處理設施存放，以供查核；並應於每年一月、四月、七月及十月十五日前，將前三個月之營運情形，填具申報表報請直轄市、縣（市）政府備查。但直轄市、縣（市）政府另有規定者，不在此限。","id":"D0070077/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"1019cad7b617a8d7262315cb52b05be4bf173c19342906da284e4cde68f49aa3","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":117,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構應於清除、處理設施、設備及清運車輛明顯處標示機構名稱、聯絡電話及營運登記證字號。","id":"D0070077/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"05d5319cbd6969180a049c4b73a316e83d4f8382d97f2281deea1f23ddeed3d9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":46,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構所置專業技術人員應負清除、處理廢棄物之責，並應於第十一條規定之申報表上簽名並蓋章。\n專業技術人員離職時，共同清理機構應即報請直轄市、縣（市）政府備查，並應於三十日內依規定另聘之。","id":"D0070077/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"4cd62cd0d8df9c0068b75f37288337e661e491497a8303abc4b7ccca53621418","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":48,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:13/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":48,"end":95,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構有下列情形之一者，直轄市、縣（市）政府得通知其限期改善；逾期未改善者，直轄市、縣（市）政府得廢止其設立許可及營運登記。但情節重大者，得逕行廢止：\n一、喪失經營業務能力或於核發登記證後連續一年內無經營共同清除、處理業務之業績者。\n二、從事未經許可之業務事項。\n三、違反本辦法規定。","id":"D0070077/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"020deb17415d29ff443f45a7f0526cf7299b9aa8287a1217b08f5322e0bf8f9f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":145,"children":[{"id":"D0070077/a:14/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":79,"end":120,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:14/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":120,"end":135,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:14/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":135,"end":145,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 15 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構停工或停業時，應於停工或停業之日起十五日內，向直轄市、縣（市）政府申請停業登記。\n前項停工或停業，除受停工或停業處分者外，最長不得逾一年。\n共同清理機構應於停工或停業期限屆滿前十五日內，檢具第九條第二項所定文件，向直轄市、縣（市）政府申請復業。","id":"D0070077/a:15","anchor":"a-15","contentHash":"de13910a88f12c5d4e46c64e725689a8c728c2651d3fa74fa9b19c3b52d4934f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:15/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":47,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:15/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":47,"end":76,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070077/a:15/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":76,"end":128,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 16 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構歇業時，應於歇業之日起三十日內填具歇業報告書，並檢具原核發之設立許可函及營運登記證，報請直轄市、縣（市）政府廢止。逾期未陳報者，直轄市、縣（市）政府得逕行廢止。","id":"D0070077/a:16","anchor":"a-16","contentHash":"0569bdacb037a70e9756e9bcd1a751ed6df0f911dcb82adb93b0a792dc900bfd","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:16/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":86,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 17 條","path":[],"text":"共同清理機構因停工、停業、歇業或經直轄市、縣（市）政府註銷營運登記證者，其未完成之清除、處理業務，直轄市、縣（市）政府應令其限期委託合法之清理機構代為清理完成，並將執行完成之報告書提報直轄市、縣（市）政府核定；逾期未完成清理者，依本法第三十四條規定辦理。","id":"D0070077/a:17","anchor":"a-17","contentHash":"872cf76713fbd2242c710a36b83270d473f77d9596e1737fd8da6b211c695690","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:17/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":127,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 18 條","path":[],"text":"直轄市、縣（市）政府辦理核發、註銷或變更營運登記證時，應副知內政部及行政院環境保護署。","id":"D0070077/a:18","anchor":"a-18","contentHash":"4a005a63b3ca9d2c43d9b6b78b42805a95313c58e23da60e5ae19d87f2b4e29e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:18/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":43,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 19 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法所定書表格式，由內政部定之。","id":"D0070077/a:19","anchor":"a-19","contentHash":"75ab921f1faa0f597ef39f2ae677089cc23230f1e12b9502e33e839ace75e2b1","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:19/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":17,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 20 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0070077/a:20","anchor":"a-20","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070077/a:20/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[{"title":"a1-1營建廢棄物共同清除處理機構設立許可申請書.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232657"},{"title":"a1-1營建廢棄物共同清除處理機構設立許可申請書.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018985"},{"title":"a1-2 資本額（財務）證明書.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232658"},{"title":"a1-2 資本額（財務）證明書.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018986"},{"title":"a1-3 投資者名冊.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232659"},{"title":"a1-3 投資者名冊.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018987"},{"title":"a1-4 廢棄物清理設施用地土地權利證明文件.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232660"},{"title":"a1-4 廢棄物清理設施用地土地權利證明文件.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018988"},{"title":"a1-5 專業技術人員資格證明文件.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232661"},{"title":"a1-5 專業技術人員資格證明文件.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018989"},{"title":"b1-1營建廢棄物共同清除處理機構登記（變更許可、登記）申請書.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232662"},{"title":"b1-1營建廢棄物共同清除處理機構登記（變更許可、登記）申請書.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018990"},{"title":"b1-2 廢棄物最終處置去處證明文件格式.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000232663"},{"title":"b1-2 廢棄物最終處置去處證明文件格式.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000018991"}],"category":"環境與其他規範","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國九十年十二月三十一日內政部（90）台內營字第 9067756  號\n  令、行政院環境保護署（90）環署廢字第 0083335  號令會銜訂定發布\n  全文 20 條；並自發布日起施行\n  中華民國一百十二年八月十八日行政院院臺規字第 1121028221 號公告\n  第 2  條、第 18 條所列屬「行政院環境保護署」之權責事項，自一百\n  十二年八月二十二日起改由「環境部」管轄","id":"D0070077","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2001-12-31","name":"營建廢棄物共同清除處理機構管理辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070077","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"62a7d5223d398a6a63f360aefcb91d08bae028d804021fd9fb6ae0c7138b45d6","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2001-12-31","effectiveDate":""}}